<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Born From Silence and Shipwrecks</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Everywhere she went, she was a sight to behold. It was never for a good reason, it was because of her â€˜deformed earsâ€™ and her shiny, scaly skin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Adora could never catch a break in her life, her siren form made people look away, turn to each other and gossip. She was a subject of everyone's interests, and none of it was anything sheâ€™d asked for. She wished people would just keep her name out of their mouths, it wasn't like she'd wanted to be born like this.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sheâ€™d spent her years at school avoiding everyone around her, coming simply to learn, finish her work, and leave. Adora didn't socialize, didn't participate in after school activities or events. If she were just a normal girl, no one would've known she was even there. Her siren origins didn't allow that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[OR]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Born from the grief of one girl, Adora grew up isolated from everyone in her life, convinced no one will understand her, until a magicat declared Adora as her best friend and never left.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
